tle":"Episodes 1-12","titleKey":"Episodes {{start}}-{{end}}","titleParams":{"start":1,"end":12},"availabilityStatus":"available","episodesLink":"6924|1|12"}]},"episodes":[{"title":"First Campaign","episodeNumber":1,"sourceEpisodeNumber":1,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"O","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[1,2,3]},{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"S","episodeNumbers":[401]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"124032","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42886","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"918427","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74018","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"343237","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"99657","synopsis":"In the year UC 798, or IC 489, the Iserlohn garrison fleet led by Admiral Attenborough encounters a huge Galactic Empire formation during a patrol mission in the Iserlohn Corridor. The Alliance ships were transporting a large number of new recruits who were supposed to have their space training there. Outnumbered, the Alliance command has no choice but to send out young and still unexperienced conscripts against well-trained Imperial forces. Julian, who was assigned to the flagship of the squadron as a Spartanian pilot, must now face his first real battle.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9090243/screencap/624f11475315b.jpg"},{"title":"Movie 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"O","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"S","episodeNumbers":[402]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"124032","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42886","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74018","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"343237","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"99658","synopsis":"Mittermeyer’s sense of justice has unleashed the wrath of Duke von Braunschweig, one of the most powerful men in the Empire. He may now be executed without going through military court. Fearing the worst, Reuenthal turns to Reinhard to save his best friend.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9090245/screencap/624f120574ffc.jpg"},{"title":"Movie 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"O","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"S","episodeNumbers":[403]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"124032","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42886","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74018","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"343237","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"99659","synopsis":"When the massive Geiersburg Fortress suddenly materializes in the Iserlohn Corridor, Caselnes immediately forwards a request for reinforcements to Heinessen, but now he must prepare for the imminent Imperial attack. Meanwhile, in Heinessen, Frederica is desperately looking for allies to save Yang.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9141231/screencap/627dadc558a43.jpg"},{"title":"Reformer","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"O","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"S","episodeNumbers":[404]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"124032","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42886","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74018","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"343237","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"99660","synopsis":"After becoming the highest military and political figure in the Empire, Reinhard starts to implement a series of major reforms, introducing a taxation system for the aristocracy and restoring freedom of speech. His policy creates both new hopes and great discontent. But Yang quietly wonders what the birth of a reformed Galactic Empire with strong popular support is going to mean for the future of the Free Planets Alliance.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9098459/screencap/624f729d808de.jpg"},{"title":"The Geier Takes Flight","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"O","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"S","episodeNumbers":[405]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"124032","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42886","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"918428","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74018","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"343237","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"99661","synopsis":"The head of the Galactic Empire's Science and Technology Department, Anton Hilmer von Schaft, is a man known for his sheer ambition. He is now presenting to Reinhard a large-scale plan to retake the long-lost Iserlohn Fortress.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9098598/screencap/6258c8971df8c.jpg"},{"title":"A Single Fine Thread","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"O","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"S","episodeNumbers":[406]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"124032","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42886","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74018","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"343237","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"99662","synopsis":"The planet Fezzan is an autonomous dominion located in one of the only two safely navigable zones that connect the Galactic Empire and the Free Planets Alliance. Every Fezzani head of state, or Landesherr, has protected the independence of the dominion by maintaining strong ties with both its much more powerful neighbors. However, the current fifth Landesherr, Adrian Rubinsky, also known as the Black Fox of Fezzan, seems intentioned to change this long-standing policy.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9111220/screencap/626226d9c5fa0.jpg"},{"title":"What Was Lost","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"O","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"S","episodeNumbers":[407]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"124032","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42886","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74018","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"343237","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"99663","synopsis":"Hilde has convinced Ernest Mecklinger, who is known in the Empire as the \"artist admiral,\" to pay a visit to her cousin, Baron Kümmel. Prone to illness and forced to stay in bed, Kümmel is a man with a penchant for great historical figures, and he strongly admires Mecklinger's brilliant mind and great skills. While Hilde is delighted to see a spark of happiness finally shining in her cousin's tired eyes, her assignment as chief secretary is about to cause her much greater concerns.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9127333/screencap/626bff5bb31cf.jpg"},{"title":"The Inquiry","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"O","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"S","episodeNumbers":[408]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"124032","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42886","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74018","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"343237","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"100527","synopsis":"A sudden recall order from the central government of the Free Planets Alliance forces Yang to head for the capital planet Heinessen. Yang assigns the command of the Iserlohn Fortress to Caselnes and von Schönkopf, and departs aboard the cruiser Leda II with minimal personnel, including his second-in-command Frederica and his guard, Machungo.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9139699/screencap/6276927c883e1.jpg"},{"title":"Movie 3","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"O","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"S","episodeNumbers":[409]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"124032","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42886","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"918429","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74018","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"343237","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"100528","synopsis":"When the massive Geiersburg Fortress suddenly materializes in the Iserlohn Corridor, Caselnes immediately forwards a request for reinforcements to Heinessen, but now he must prepare for the imminent Imperial attack. Meanwhile, in Heinessen, Frederica is desperately looking for allies to save Yang.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9141231/screencap/627dadc558a43.jpg"},{"title":"Fortress vs. Fortress Akt I: Cannon Fire","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"O","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"S","episodeNumbers":[410]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"124032","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42886","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74018","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"343237","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"100529","synopsis":"Admiral Kempff, Commander-in-Chief of the Geiersburg Imperial expeditionary force, sends a peremptory declaration of war to the Alliance garrison of Iserlohn. Then Geiersburg's main gun suddenly opens fire with devastating results. On Iserlohn, a confused Caselnes and his officers do not seem to agree on the best strategy to take...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9139700/screencap/628751e3e87eb.jpg"},{"title":"Fortress vs. Fortress Akt II: Fierce Fighting","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"O","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"S","episodeNumbers":[411]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"124032","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42886","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74018","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"343237","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"100530","synopsis":"The Imperial fleet relentlessly conducts their assault on the Iserlohn Corridor, one blow after another. As Caselnes is still struggling with organizing an effective resistance, Imperial armored infantry units have landed on Iserlohn, and threaten to establish a bridgehead. Then, former Imperial admiral Merkatz, who defected to the Alliance, asks to be assigned temporary command of the garrison fleet.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9139717/screencap/6290574d27664.jpg"},{"title":"Fortress vs. Fortress Akt III: The Return of the Magician","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"O","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"S","episodeNumbers":[412]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"124032","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42886","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74018","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"343237","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"100531","synopsis":"An Alliance relief fleet is finally heading to the Iserlohn Corridor, but combat forces on the battlefield are limited, and a wrong move could turn fatal. Should the Iserlohn garrison fleet be unable to break the blockade imposed by Kempff's ships, the reinforcements from Heinessen would be easily destroyed. On the command bridge of Iserlohn, Caselnes and his officers animatedly discuss the countermeasures, but what sounds like the best plan comes from somebody most unexpected.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9139774/screencap/629946257ef04.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":124032,"malId":42886},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-28T07:48:11Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:124032","mal:42886"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"O","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12|-4":"1-3","1-12":"1-3|4"}},{"provider":"anidb","id":"15728","scope":"S","ranges":{"1-12":"401-412"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"124032","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"42886","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"918427","ranges":{"1-4|-4":"1","1-4":"1|4"}},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"918428","ranges":{"5-8|-4":"1","5-8":"1|4"}},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"918429","ranges":{"9-12|-4":"1","9-12":"1|4"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"74018","scope":"s3","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"343237","scope":"s3","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}}]},"sourceMet